@prefix : <https://example.org/test#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
:Person a owl:Class . :Human a owl:Class; owl:equivalentClass :Person .
:Animal a owl:Class . :PetOwner a owl:Class; owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction; owl:onProperty :owns; owl:someValuesFrom :Animal ] .
:owns a owl:ObjectProperty; rdfs:domain :Person; rdfs:range :Animal .
:Alice a owl:NamedIndividual; :owns :Cat .
:Cat a owl:NamedIndividual .
